.TH CRUNCH_PUTPMSG 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_putpmsg \- invokes obsolete streams syscall slot 182, unimplemented on linux x86-64
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/legacy_syscalls.h>
.B long crunch_putpmsg(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes obsolete STREAMS syscall slot 182, unimplemented on Linux x86-64. Seccomp or other policy may instead return a different error.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR putpmsg (2)
